sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is ISO15118-20 transaction started in V2X AC_BPT energy transfer mode

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a TxDefaultProfile charging profile with operationMode Idle

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose must be TxDefaultProfile<br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.chargingSchedulePeriod[0].operationMode must be Idle
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = OperationModeChanged, transactionInfo.operationMode = Idle)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
